{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/c6e0c73627424a8773ec04878abe54f5.avif?t=1759658165\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The camera doesn't lie, but the truth isn't always obvious. Step into the role of a detective investigating crime scenes where every detail matters and every photograph could be the key to solving the case.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your camera, you'll document crucial evidence at crime scenes - photograph traces, examine objects from every angle, and capture details that reveal the story behind each crime. Every piece of evidence you gather builds toward one goal: identifying the murderer and predicting their next strike before another victim falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/d8de7e8cfb1a08c8dd6fa4e23749223c.poster.avif?t=1759658165\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/d8de7e8cfb1a08c8dd6fa4e23749223c.webm?t=1759658165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/d8de7e8cfb1a08c8dd6fa4e23749223c.mp4?t=1759658165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back at your detective office, the real investigation begins. Link clues on your detective board, connecting photographs, evidence, and leads until patterns emerge. Search police databases for key information - verify suspects, cross-reference data, and uncover connections that others have missed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/7b506c67518ee52866fb130b0439ace3.poster.avif?t=1759658165\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/7b506c67518ee52866fb130b0439ace3.webm?t=1759658165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/7b506c67518ee52866fb130b0439ace3.mp4?t=1759658165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple: identify the culprit and determine where they'll strike again. Each case presents a standalone mystery with its own unique crime scenes, evidence, and suspects. Some cases will test your observation skills, others will challenge your deductive reasoning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The truth is out there, waiting to be photographed, analyzed, and solved.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/551a6a18e145467394706c789caa9142.poster.avif?t=1759658165\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/551a6a18e145467394706c789caa9142.webm?t=1759658165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/551a6a18e145467394706c789caa9142.mp4?t=1759658165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/4f979bf1d1b4fbff238cbb8513a7a5df.avif?t=1759658165\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crime Scene Photography</strong> - Document evidence with precision and capture crucial details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective Board Investigation</strong> - Connect clues, photos, and leads to uncover the truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police Database Access</strong> - Search archives and cross-reference information</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evidence Analysis</strong> - Examine objects, rotate them, and discover hidden clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Investigation Pace</strong> - Solve cases at your own rhythm without time pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standalone Cases</strong> - Each mystery is complete and independent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Crime Scenes</strong> - Explore multiple locations, each hiding vital evidence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Criminal Profiling</strong> - Use evidence to predict the killer's next move</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923680?t=1759658165","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923680?t=1759658165","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/14117cee770f49fab05c84bc8c4d591eb932bee2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759658165","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/14117cee770f49fab05c84bc8c4d591eb932bee2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759658165","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Interactive investigation of murder scenes with visible blood. Occasional strong language."},"demos":[{"appid":3944340,"description":""}],"detailed_